{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_fa77276f7d4b","title":"我的安全视界观","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488255&idx=1&sn=c517c0e79fb525ab4c8ac84de4b13dc7&chksm=ea9374d7ba7061e3cf8fda49859f1fa9006365802ee90c3446782536a9f9871539550ce7ea48&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"网络空间安全双高工\n国内头部安全企业网络安全部副总经理\n横跨甲乙方十余年实战经验，深耕软件安全，首创「研发安全运营架构与实践」方法论。BCS2025企业安全防护与运营一体化出品人，持续输出安全实战干货，助力安全从业者与企业少走弯路~","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"我的安全视界观","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM7E4UfVRcsYUUnMic6CkEXG99IpgTibwibz1ND7LXGm2KZicQ%2F0","updated":"2026-11-15T22:49:29.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488255:1","title":"AI渗透：它做对了什么，又在哪里把我带偏？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488255&idx=1&sn=c517c0e79fb525ab4c8ac84de4b13dc7&chksm=ea9374d7ba7061e3cf8fda49859f1fa9006365802ee90c3446782536a9f9871539550ce7ea48&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"我让 AI 连跑了 20 轮渗透测试，目标很直接：把扫描结果打成可利用，拿到 shell。\n\n它确实能干活。读压缩产物、给 550 多个 API 排风险顺序、拆 gRPC-Web 协议，最后找出 34 个未授权接口。写报告也比我快。可工具链也会卡住：一个 1.5MB 的文件就因为内容审批超时，整轮白白耗掉。\n\n但它最会骗人的地方，是给错误结论配一个合理故事。一次枚举出“33 个账号里 32 个存在”，它顺嘴解释成“可能有一批测试账号”。我差点信了，拿随机用户名一测才发现是 IP 级风控。从那以后我定了条死规矩：所有结论必须能指回一条原始响应，指不出就标“未验证”。\n\n前 18 轮我一直在找 shell，其实第 4 轮就扫到一个不登录、ID 连续、能直接下载客户名单的接口。我把“没打进内网”当成没结果，硬拖到第 19 轮才换视角。\n\n所以提示词不用写多细。30 条里真正改变走向的就三句：“别搞内网域名”“从数据安全角度测”“把hunter用起来”。其余大多是“继续”“还不够”。\n\nAI 适合批量执行，但“什么算找到东西”必须人定。门槛低了，判断反而更贵。","content":"<p>我让 AI 连跑了 20 轮渗透测试，目标很直接：把扫描结果打成可利用，拿到 shell。<br /><br />它确实能干活。读压缩产物、给 550 多个 API 排风险顺序、拆 gRPC-Web 协议，最后找出 34 个未授权接口。写报告也比我快。可工具链也会卡住：一个 1.5MB 的文件就因为内容审批超时，整轮白白耗掉。<br /><br />但它最会骗人的地方，是给错误结论配一个合理故事。一次枚举出“33 个账号里 32 个存在”，它顺嘴解释成“可能有一批测试账号”。我差点信了，拿随机用户名一测才发现是 IP 级风控。从那以后我定了条死规矩：所有结论必须能指回一条原始响应，指不出就标“未验证”。<br /><br />前 18 轮我一直在找 shell，其实第 4 轮就扫到一个不登录、ID 连续、能直接下载客户名单的接口。我把“没打进内网”当成没结果，硬拖到第 19 轮才换视角。<br /><br />所以提示词不用写多细。30 条里真正改变走向的就三句：“别搞内网域名”“从数据安全角度测”“把hunter用起来”。其余大多是“继续”“还不够”。<br /><br />AI 适合批量执行，但“什么算找到东西”必须人定。门槛低了，判断反而更贵。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawlr0XaUw81g7KQZxIAypBeguj6uibYtGI0kFR7oy0zqp4V7pdz4sX1ic1WoGjyrCWtUwdMI9JTabibU7at6iaXiaAwYlXMbcCgbtnYw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawlAK9OeYOzaN1uW6YvfMTVNLfvRcxop5TmCSqAX3H0EeQ6QB8QicgdiaxpRuic1FmvIDiaWfibLbTB1JSicBxkPfzTKHeZ4sd6FsicatQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawmfqmvdTXU0B02eCkCJEjibB98RSXds1ljjjhWgM7EKhiaFqz03fxXhzTm9fkWWwcoI16MmiaZ3kmaApfYM8MHYjylKaLtK7nPib2w%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawlic1erOU02MrEl7R0KMp1YO0hqeTiaowpUib0SkEoiadZeaa6v1SmzmTAKx17ZJOaH6b0k9A303auKIbflCZRJDPIBnWT9u4QeOpk%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawmothtPjyAf5gHG6Q9ibYF4Rib3g5ltRGeCic6lMfDic7cRvibvGgpPNotWsCr0VtVJpfym1QrKNMJyngic6Wu1mwp9wvZCh3IweAp84%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawkt3eb4D8FzRnzq7G2pyiaxibdANoH7rWFo5v61RbBtADpmThI6bxXVicwJyoqia4Le55GN1MabClqrtpFgBzqSL15AXVNFxw4ia0ZY%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawlr0XaUw81g7KQZxIAypBeguj6uibYtGI0kFR7oy0zqp4V7pdz4sX1ic1WoGjyrCWtUwdMI9JTabibU7at6iaXiaAwYlXMbcCgbtnYw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawlr0XaUw81g7KQZxIAypBeguj6uibYtGI0kFR7oy0zqp4V7pdz4sX1ic1WoGjyrCWtUwdMI9JTabibU7at6iaXiaAwYlXMbcCgbtnYw%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawlAK9OeYOzaN1uW6YvfMTVNLfvRcxop5TmCSqAX3H0EeQ6QB8QicgdiaxpRuic1FmvIDiaWfibLbTB1JSicBxkPfzTKHeZ4sd6FsicatQ%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawmfqmvdTXU0B02eCkCJEjibB98RSXds1ljjjhWgM7EKhiaFqz03fxXhzTm9fkWWwcoI16MmiaZ3kmaApfYM8MHYjylKaLtK7nPib2w%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawlic1erOU02MrEl7R0KMp1YO0hqeTiaowpUib0SkEoiadZeaa6v1SmzmTAKx17ZJOaH6b0k9A303auKIbflCZRJDPIBnWT9u4QeOpk%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawmothtPjyAf5gHG6Q9ibYF4Rib3g5ltRGeCic6lMfDic7cRvibvGgpPNotWsCr0VtVJpfym1QrKNMJyngic6Wu1mwp9wvZCh3IweAp84%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawkt3eb4D8FzRnzq7G2pyiaxibdANoH7rWFo5v61RbBtADpmThI6bxXVicwJyoqia4Le55GN1MabClqrtpFgBzqSL15AXVNFxw4ia0ZY%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-15T22:49:29.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488215:1","title":"PHP2Shell应急：从漏洞情报到业务影响","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488215&idx=1&sn=6243ea28ce47103aee4579b7e6fb3dea&chksm=ea35f93dd2253fa22757d895297602ecbbb1413695c35e1448bdac6e785456180c1bb7028917&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"10 月 22 号凌晨，我们还在群里讨论 PHP2Shell 怎么修。第二天一早就被拉进公司级应急群，劈头就问：哪些产品受影响？客户那边怎么回？\n\n这俩问题其实是一回事——能不能把“网上说能打”，翻译成“我们到底会不会被打”。我测了几十个用 PHP 的产品，按公开 POC 都没复现。但这绝不等于不受影响。\n\n那个 POC 是在特定版本和配置下打通的。我们的产品是 CGI PHP 7.X，没跑通只能说明那条路走不通。没做对照验证、没覆盖其他 SAPI，就不能写“安全”。\n\n企业应急真正稀缺的，是把漏洞翻译成业务影响的人。同一个洞，对外网系统是 P0 立刻下线，对内网 FPM 可能只是 P2 计划升级。\n\n现在我用 AI 去扫资产，只让它跑只读命令，把版本和配置拉回来。但隔离复现和拍板决策，还得靠人。下次遇到这事，我会先开个 30 分钟的会，把现状和未知摆到桌面上。","content":"<p>10 月 22 号凌晨，我们还在群里讨论 PHP2Shell 怎么修。第二天一早就被拉进公司级应急群，劈头就问：哪些产品受影响？客户那边怎么回？<br /><br />这俩问题其实是一回事——能不能把“网上说能打”，翻译成“我们到底会不会被打”。我测了几十个用 PHP 的产品，按公开 POC 都没复现。但这绝不等于不受影响。<br /><br />那个 POC 是在特定版本和配置下打通的。我们的产品是 CGI PHP 7.X，没跑通只能说明那条路走不通。没做对照验证、没覆盖其他 SAPI，就不能写“安全”。<br /><br />企业应急真正稀缺的，是把漏洞翻译成业务影响的人。同一个洞，对外网系统是 P0 立刻下线，对内网 FPM 可能只是 P2 计划升级。<br /><br />现在我用 AI 去扫资产，只让它跑只读命令，把版本和配置拉回来。但隔离复现和拍板决策，还得靠人。下次遇到这事，我会先开个 30 分钟的会，把现状和未知摆到桌面上。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawloiarYUHMJMcPQSproiaqarAs86a25pJBAsGWx0YzvribiadicMribTBAZj1r5FXvAlIDNia85ZjlXWZe5GmWjO2elypKuib1B16kDsks%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawlYS2Y7FtCG4R1x3O7jNHM4ngjBCS4b0UGuoOK81Ya18apG9JQUTYfzccDm22icia3gUluMCK4vonDYELias36MdgnIZttVaUKGco%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawkju5l1nUPkeMjHmkiauzeQmXAPVj0eLiaYLruLlnEGK6VFYJwUcAvdbp0SFBZgk2v0gTZh3V3Ot46KBNrgnuiamrXcFUSWk0wicm8%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawm9rtg2k5iavvFNkIfJMQuicia4gD9zeB7mkTEjHXBibgzPeLQW99kMfBOPMuPoO6uMqHmSA7uguibX6P3qiacltibAXMIPv5aibzOQxWk%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawm5iaPoAoGbDfGTia3TIVpG4jZMzpdviadKEIN8K7CWmcCjibZaMIzUaCzUXp7iaZbhnmUvnvicDvk9KrUaZLuNbELNPGSrmgtyBicQp4%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawnhxicMYQXSanyFAnRXLyqFLpGaYNPg9SgzUXE6H7Yytlt8Rl5ShePOE3bIu50bXdDvfnEQXiaxIujZChFF0iaDcSEibXBWH5zkIn0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawkZnaqiculBMOslqHOWrJqsZB5ywiaq1vGiaMYgiaiaU3xAsibvITyy9c58zTmSXsQ60Et4YAzBSwicvte9qIynrH5JbfY4ugkjcqflOc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawloiarYUHMJMcPQSproiaqarAs86a25pJBAsGWx0YzvribiadicMribTBAZj1r5FXvAlIDNia85ZjlXWZe5GmWjO2elypKuib1B16kDsks%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawlYS2Y7FtCG4R1x3O7jNHM4ngjBCS4b0UGuoOK81Ya18apG9JQUTYfzccDm22icia3gUluMCK4vonDYELias36MdgnIZttVaUKGco%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawkju5l1nUPkeMjHmkiauzeQmXAPVj0eLiaYLruLlnEGK6VFYJwUcAvdbp0SFBZgk2v0gTZh3V3Ot46KBNrgnuiamrXcFUSWk0wicm8%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawm9rtg2k5iavvFNkIfJMQuicia4gD9zeB7mkTEjHXBibgzPeLQW99kMfBOPMuPoO6uMqHmSA7uguibX6P3qiacltibAXMIPv5aibzOQxWk%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawm5iaPoAoGbDfGTia3TIVpG4jZMzpdviadKEIN8K7CWmcCjibZaMIzUaCzUXp7iaZbhnmUvnvicDvk9KrUaZLuNbELNPGSrmgtyBicQp4%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FJFR9icl1yawnhxicMYQXSanyFAnRXLyqFLpGaYNPg9SgzUXE6H7Yytlt8Rl5ShePOE3bIu50bXdDvfnEQXiaxIujZChFF0iaDcSEibXBWH5zkIn0%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-15T22:49:29.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488248:1","title":"AI渗透：它做对了什么，又在哪里把我带偏？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488248&idx=1&sn=1a763e086ee1b048aa8f60420efe301d&chksm=ea2194ad95b6e276644bb808c42ab395032c2488afec81b45d855ac8e4195d664d5b423d1d47&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"继续上一篇AI 渗透 20 轮：5 条链打通，12 条链卡住。看看AI在整个过程中，哪些地方做对了，哪些把我带偏了？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawkZ7pyTbo6BKHicYiaS3feyAicEPup4BicfZPB308kPBUXxdkHGylNtYHNiaIRJhQRmen38goRky4FLRJEU8f3sWlIpKMSSkeCaTOhU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-15T22:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488225:1","title":"我的读书笔记：升维，是把问题变少","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488225&idx=1&sn=e03be4afc8d8269e7bab6af1e3ecdeac&chksm=ea6455183b2327bf20b9e2c6e36e1ad8f2f7c1db2ba60138c1cd7983cf3184cf017d9deb666f&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"救火救得越勤，越该问问火从哪里起。有些道理，读的时候轻轻放过，真到事上才知分量。推不动的整改、清不完的告警，如今我会先停一停，想想它在更高一层里是什么模样。想通了，话就短了，事也少了。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawmwiahu9LHWlsWXzqcR2rxPBQk4hRWqY83ZUjA2tWmUqoGs3DgDkzFye5OQzIFZ95yRmWGicGvUFegV0rxbrrwdqr6NAlmrzyHfA%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T22:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488202:1","title":"AI 渗透 20 轮：5 条链打通，12 条链卡住","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488202&idx=1&sn=1e79186c93846c8edad343f259d13955&chksm=ea9d80e38f330397aa8c45d7a6aff411cf0410f6a8418d8b240950e7e4094696725d7fc84851&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"关于AI渗透测试的体验，通用agent + 模型就能干很多事儿，半夜躺在被窝里拿手机就能渗透，并且效果很好~","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawkhHBhdZLwWEHnkLnFwLZNKIKRyApgZnVBUic6fmT5xKQegiah5AZHFWIaNPFvFOmhC3AVBUkajibm4og4Oz3yrVguPm9Ze1OJIA8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-08T22:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488189:1","title":"我的读书笔记：优势从哪来，跟昨天的自己比","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488189&idx=1&sn=113a259b4221ccedd3d2c349665bf610&chksm=ea4d043661d7d37ee0e46232475fdf628ada942e79867e386b741f585265b197295c4e454085&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"人只要长着眼睛，就忍不住跟身边人比，可比出来的是嫉妒或安慰，都比坏了。今早立冬，点开台灯翻出三年前页边的旧笔记，当年打问号的地方，有的有了答案，有的还悬着。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawmf3RTSFDicRq94om7VEq21ibicDXj8MIGCYkJ0rxTvy1uwGIyAQgka4RSJP8Tsbu8yGyCm6twIbSzVPhicfEOJFWnQtibW1vEgGyOE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-07T00:23:33.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488183:1","title":"ShadowScan：让 AI 参与判定的影子端点扫描器","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488183&idx=1&sn=e5cdf7d011e0810660d2c9bd06ce62b6&chksm=eabeda3ecd24fc41edd6c1831c773da262f63a6ee959b8fd615a93bea1bd776491dbd4adf8ce&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"影子端点（Druid、Swagger、Actuator、.git 等）不在台账上，通用漏扫也扫不到。ShadowScan 用\"规则引擎 + 三层 AI\"补上这个盲区：让 AI 看到真实响应再判定，并只保留提议权、执行权留在代码里。725 个域名实测，人工确认 27 条，真实率 82%。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawnciby7C7gTicZWxiaOmibQL2ITbyHic8VurqgpagfrGro4PxkNZy18NTwaw9RTXWx6AaURdiaPLeFqRcmpZK36jLWlNJEWtEYjGbzkc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-01T22:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488170:1","title":"我的读书笔记：呆得太爽，就会有问题","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488170&idx=1&sn=e8cfbe6819f9d7fd73047531c6a31aea&chksm=eacd206518d17feb6bcf74ace3bfd1497c4204428af9c0f95b0599f1acec8b11b087cd0e255d&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"人待在舒服的位置久了，是会变钝的。那年我正安逸，顺手在笔记里写下九个字：呆得太爽，就会有问题。如今回头看，那句话比什么鸡汤都管用。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawkO3gTlibkBPXMYBo2QpdLJ7bFPADoYkHU0hpFJuVjhtTVzIo74e91OwV5XkjQibUIBzvd4SCu2bOJpdZH9FgKwibWOg6vj274tIg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-30T23:58:07.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488160:1","title":"PHP2Shell应急：从漏洞情报到业务影响，中间隔着什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488160&idx=1&sn=a34f4a244fb8c3fbfad4cff6623f7e0c&chksm=ea75c5bec8ddbaaeb66aba1a4519b3b0fc8145a74467890126e733c0d8726e880a90915cdae7&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"这次 PHP2Shell 之后，我一直在想一个问题：企业应急里最难、最稀缺的，是不是漏洞分析和复现能力？情报获取其实不难，难的是看到漏洞之后，尤其是有 POC 的高门槛漏洞，还要认真分析它对业务系统的实际影响，再决定要不要发起应急响应。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawmHNemTmxGiafTa6aop1xhcj4yJRniaxIg4No6jiayPW8wShvSWlwNOibsZ0otd9G933mhKudmynia5sBvb7Yz0CsvniaMu35nXJlkNY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-27T16:11:05.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488147:1","title":"我的读书笔记：把自己当成一家私人公司","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488147&idx=1&sn=1078ac7ce4b922f3f17507af4aaa9867&chksm=ead2567a671630b45f00bb7c8a54b980d9809a9d46183ce86c535c1b365cb9772dec0f5e58ba&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"都说别把公司当自己家。我倒觉得，该把自己当一家公司经营 - - 只不过公司是你最大的舞台、第一个客户，你在这儿的业绩就是你的业绩。环境不顺、薪资不够高就觉得浪费时间？那亏的是你自己这家公司。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawniawEhDXk2bClyPd8ibGszbVtrfcozJBusNHUBp2lEbT2UpALW4370ou7icTyicMGa6cq3YqZaAscjH6EniaQh5oCguXC4iazVia9DFw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-24T15:39:01.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488142:1","title":"影子端点专项扫描：AI \"用进\"安全的一次实践","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488142&idx=1&sn=53f068608266cd4d018cf465f22facae&chksm=eae284125864c52ce3aacf36b7bdbe3e7a2d4cdc157fab5c5d2119e271cd36f5eb7fafacc11c&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"文章复盘了一次用 AI 做\"影子端点\"专项扫描的实战：把 AI 从\"报告润色器\"升级为\"自适应扩探 + 证据验证\"的判案角色。从 V1 喂结论、V2 喂证据到 V3 约束型智能体，讲透 AI 提权与边界约束的平衡，以及误报从 103 条压到 16 条的工程细节。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawk94xlglyMms7mb06fc99ibfKtlGpngdn4yibeY7gGZ8gqObdgaB4IOgc0xia6PPicKgIwCoaOPlUiaHG4K1GRY92NJlWUT6SHicW8Zk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-18T22:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488123:1","title":"我的读书笔记：写作是留给自己的吸管","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488123&idx=1&sn=11f0969c1d668339096059d4e0bba9d1&chksm=ea73f90a16c7ceb8362d979fc8bf7322cb70a23310410ca5dc5baeb4ebc443c6c5a514647d82&scene=126&sessionid=1795145992#rd","description":"写作是我的吸管 - - 白天被会议和救火切得七零八落，只有键盘上那段时间完全属于自己。公众号写了九年，从两位数粉丝到快一万，雪确实在滚；靠的不是自律，是「反复重复，催生行动」。爱好再热爱，也不挤占家和工作的边界，业余选手拼的是十年总量。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawk302IEVc6msrKSTIrojXokFwiciaYDOsOxiaheVAz0Cb05DQJHerRjbyxtKmCQ5rfEsTwLKNRjNz6fibAJbanCxBBNQ8rh3yUJ1HI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-17T00:57:50.000Z"}]}